[{"client_msg_id":"cdefce8e-e982-4b52-935b-17dce9bc2e6e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"速くなってくれ。","ts":"1628256060.084800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VOh8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9b106b0-db26-4c3a-aadf-0520467e95c8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"entgo の author にベンチマーカーを共有した。","ts":"1628256055.084500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":2,"users":["U8CC7MDCL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7HGc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ffe21a6-8604-4407-8309-9bfc16c3087c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なんで beego こんな速いんやろ。","ts":"1628255432.084100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+20l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e423179e-41ba-40b6-805f-c03cd507ed4b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、これベンチマーカーのソースだった。","ts":"1628255421.083800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dAqd0"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U019YFMPPLG","text":"\u003c@U019YFMPPLG\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628241281.083400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"4725b9b1-1b61-4d3e-9199-221d01d7feda","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや単にベンチマークのエラーハンドリングがおかしいのか。","ts":"1628241133.083200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"djv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5ce2923-833d-41c2-ac5d-9a59a838fb8c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"エラーの取り扱いを、使う側に選ばせないってこと?","ts":"1628241088.082900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qzp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab4fb08d-ec4d-49c4-ab4b-a39fe65554e7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"beego、やけに速いなと思ってソースを見てるんですが、エラー時に `fmt.Println` 等があり、速くても標準出力するライブラリもアレだなぁ、などと思いました。\n\u003chttps://github.com/beego/orm-benchmark/blob/66c38565ab833f39c1bd4e0a2841ab8086e161b9/benchs/beego_orm.go#L37\u003e","ts":"1628240302.082300","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/beego/orm-benchmark/blob/66c38565ab833f39c1bd4e0a2841ab8086e161b9/benchs/beego_orm.go | beego_orm.go\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/beego/orm-benchmark/blob/66c38565ab833f39c1bd4e0a2841ab8086e161b9/benchs/beego_orm.go | beego_orm.go\u003e","text":"```\n\t\t\tfmt.Println(err)\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/beego/orm-benchmark|beego/orm-benchmark\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6TrB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a93fbbc-a448-4680-8028-1d863926ac48","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ent そんな速くないですが、僕的には許容範囲という結論です。","ts":"1628235670.081100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVgUD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5c185cf-8263-4542-8053-d2f744eea76b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"各種 orm のベンチマーク貼っておきます。\n\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/mattn/827c271dca170e603b337fbd1764d436\u003e","ts":"1628235632.080700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gYob"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8128fb3b-1c6b-4662-9fab-ed6fef9dde77","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"その後の話ですが、僕は ent に行くことにしました。","ts":"1628235596.080400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hZvIy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33660447-fca8-4ad5-b323-bcdd7550f7db","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"なるほど、積み重ねですね・・・","ts":"1628230393.079900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X8f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3f36f41-a0ff-4e2e-9f1d-e952224596ca","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ根気よくやってれば、って感じじゃないですか。","ts":"1628228603.079000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f43"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a713d798-10f3-44b6-847d-8d47db52c6bb","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"実装見るとどこも頑張ってるなあと思います。とても真似できないw","ts":"1628227181.078500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PyYK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38e98d4c-ba53-4a66-a9df-234ee494d095","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁうまいこと(どろくさいこと)やっているんだとは思う。","ts":"1628227144.078100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X8UEp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0878a8de-0901-489d-a6f9-cc7adecfa185","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"同じフィールド名があったときにバグがないか、だけは気になるな。","ts":"1628227109.077800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XNeS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"711c37cb-b6e7-41f0-8ae6-936a48eeec4e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たしかにフィールド名しか返ってきてない。1つ目のテーブルとして解釈して知らないフィールドが出てきたら2つ目のテーブルとして解釈、みたいなことやってるのかもね。","ts":"1628227097.077400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e15"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8d220d8-1124-40d1-b02c-d8bad54143ae","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちょっとDBに繋いでどう返ってくるか見てみるか。","ts":"1628226933.076500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1xh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e5b5e4d-94fc-4fa7-b75f-f1c520e2336b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`SELECT A.*, L.*, P.* FROM A LEFT OUTER JOIN L ON L.id = A.id LEFT OUT JOIN ...;` こんなの生成してるな。まぁあとは順番名前で照合、なのかな。","ts":"1628226921.076100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e+A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"371477eb-0afe-48c0-ab5e-7b135dacb916","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うw 生成してるな","ts":"1628226826.075500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sweat_smile","count":1,"users":["U023Z8L90BG"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v19Os"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6603a587-c5d4-4f4f-9031-58041a7bd798","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちょっとログ確認してみるか。","ts":"1628226658.075000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dqy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f3c810d-b1f4-4a72-86a5-d67460b0b241","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ORMが `*` 含むSQLを生成するのは基本NG","ts":"1628226598.074500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628226640.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4gqLe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bc462e7-043a-41d2-8d87-9f2fe1ca5b23","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"sql.Rowsからは `x.n` ではなく、 `n`でカラム名が来るので、マッピングはレコード内のカラムの順番依存になるということですかね","ts":"1628226593.074000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nr+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce76e3b2-c2b7-4dc1-968f-76c1e4c136c9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁORMがやるなら普通はカラム全列挙だよね。","ts":"1628226557.073000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/GI7Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb2b295e-b8ab-49c5-bc77-69c8a4a591f2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ select x.*, y.* でも行けるんかな?","ts":"1628226518.072200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Cnha"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4eebf229-4e58-4045-8a77-7bda3b38c734","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"select * でもならなかったっけ?","ts":"1628226506.071800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iCa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01609cfb-43f6-4bf7-b91c-e3cbad28e4f6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そそ","ts":"1628226498.071500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YCcL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de219fcd-cb7b-492c-a8ee-f69bb947e6a6","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"あー、クエリのカラム自体にテーブル名を埋め込んで、`select x.n, y.n from x join y` のようなクエリを構築しているということですか？","ts":"1628226485.071000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XKFF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57e1ecbe-10c5-426c-b90d-a9612e25bccc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"↑で答えになってる?","ts":"1628226479.070900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dzm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef2333bc-cdd3-45f4-b28c-dedefe2b86a2","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"すみません、もう少し詳しく聞きたいです。\nxormがそれできるのは知ってるのですが、クエリで取ってきたレコードのカラムをどうやってXとYにマッピングしているのか分からず。","ts":"1628226437.070000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0nHM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef965958-7eeb-400c-bdfd-0be9a5df4022","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"普通にやればColumnType.Name()に `x.n` とか `y.n` とか入ってるからパースして振り分けしてるはず。","ts":"1628226428.069600","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628226436.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Wbd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd801547-44da-4933-8672-7c8e5369532f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"XYのXとYにタグでマーキングしてる。","ts":"1628226330.068400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZD0Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e187db20-07f1-4d26-bb21-8f7396d82d49","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"xormだとね。","ts":"1628226309.067900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ctyu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0a74092-6911-43db-8fbb-9bcdbdffa3ca","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`type X struct { N int } ; type struct Y { N int }; type struct XY { X; Y }` こういうイメージ","ts":"1628226298.067300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DgL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7797482-27c8-447d-8d80-e38a86c8ff90","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"`select * from x join y ...` みたいなクエリを `struct { X, Y }` のような構造体にマッピングしたいんですよね。XとYが同じ名前のカラムを持ってるとどっちにマッピングしたらいいか困る。上で書いてるツールでは雑に取得順に構造体の並び順でマッピングするというやりかたを取っています。","ts":"1628226077.066400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jmj0U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b22429b1-521a-4dfb-809e-4743e6abdf39","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"テーブルはそうですね！困りどころ","ts":"1628225803.063500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2FdM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a5059a6-50a1-45d7-954b-df01a9d317f5","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"実行時にsql.Rows等からテーブル名求めることはできないので、取得したカラムがどのテーブルに属するのかが分からないのが今の悩みです。それを決め打ちでマッピングするしかないと表現しました。","ts":"1628225772.063200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Z7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"637d712b-03c2-4dd1-9403-09d9a5055c36","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕の経験上おおまかにORMは、まずクエリビルダがあって、その上でスキーママイグレーターがあって、で最後にO/Rマッパーっていう構成になってないと、だいたい困る。\n\nそんでクエリビルダの出来が全部に影響してしまう感じ。","ts":"1628225560.060200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mNY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0381d69-3b2d-4c10-bb70-4d484e6498fd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとはinformation_schemaからゴニョゴニョするやつもあった気がするけど、気のせい(別の言語)かも。","ts":"1628225384.055800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628225393.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f4zP5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"643dcb35-f698-4152-8caa-bffa82ff3638","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"xormは構造体名からテーブル名、フィールド名からカラム名へのマッピングをカスタムすることもできる。だいたいできるとはおもうけど。","ts":"1628225352.055100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BdG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59fda80d-48b8-49d2-af38-f5b739873531","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"できないわけではないか。やってるのは見たことないですが。","ts":"1628225287.054200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MvA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fcbb2e0d-2a37-43ea-b5f2-5ec0d749e7d8","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"実行時に実際のテーブル情報からマッピングすることはできないので、sqlcみたいにDDLからマッピングするか、構造体名やタグで決め打ちでテーブル名算出してそこにマッピングするかですね。","ts":"1628225267.053800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w1zSt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ade56a81-0cfa-4fad-9ebe-861935958a0f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"naruhodo","ts":"1628225216.052800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Dp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfa6048c-c429-408a-95ef-680d8a2cc3dd","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"sqlxみたいにリフレクションでとか\n\u003chttps://jmoiron.github.io/sqlx/\u003e","ts":"1628225213.052600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F/R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a57414f2-ecf7-4d53-837b-2b746648fbb5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"sqlcみたいにSQL先行は珍しい。","ts":"1628225185.051900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628225199.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d6CP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e283a99-0ffd-4999-9f29-131244c9a221","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あるよう。っていうか大体その方式。","ts":"1628225179.051700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ci68/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d99398c0-42d5-4f7d-b8c4-be91037858a6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go の OR マッピング全然しらないのですが、構造体タグとテーブルを自動的にマッピングするツールとかってあるんですか?","ts":"1628224993.051400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G8Faq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db61f4b7-8a95-47b6-990e-17d162d1b9f3","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"あんまり複雑なツール作るつもりはないんですが、ここでのORMに関する議論はいつも参考にしてます！","ts":"1628224779.050400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x3b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88e36aae-5bd3-4648-a409-577d35498157","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"チャレンジャー!","ts":"1628224414.049400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zzIwy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"654a68cb-6c2f-4954-b2c7-3b48ea2fc89b","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"変にオブジェクト指向的にマッピングするからややこしくなると考えてgo-generateで構造体とレコードのマッピングするツール作ってます\n\nまだ作りかけですけど晒してみる\n\u003chttps://github.com/minoritea/srm\u003e","ts":"1628224091.049000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"minoritea/srm","id":1,"title":"minoritea/srm","fields":[{"title":"Language","value":"Go","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"4 days ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M84sF"}]}]
